.fkst/
fkst.env
target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- learning model (codex-learn) state discipline ---
# COMMITTED  : the DISTILLED learning artifacts under data/learning/
#              (rubric_history/, relearn_log.jsonl, engagement_styleguide.md,
#              pr_styleguide.md) + data/area_rubric.json. codex-learn/relearn is
#              the ONLY writer of these banks; they are tracked + reviewable.
# GITIGNORED : the RAW durable runtime `outcomes` + engine state. They live under
#              .fkst/ (ignored above: .fkst/durable + .fkst/runtime are scratch/state).
# Guard: a raw `outcomes*.jsonl` must NEVER be committed even if a run drops one
# under data/ ; data/learning's distilled banks are NOT matched, so they stay tracked.
data/**/outcomes*.jsonl
.fkst/durable/
.fkst/runtime/

# Session build-state note (local only, not part of the product)
RESUME.md
